```console
$ scherzo-cloud workflow view --help
View a published local workflow attempt

Usage: scherzo-cloud workflow view [OPTIONS] <RUN_DIR>

Arguments:
  <RUN_DIR>  Directory containing the workflow run

Options:
      --attempt <NUMBER>  Attempt number to view (defaults to the current attempt)
      --plain             Force plain human presentation
      --json              Print the result as JSON
      --color <WHEN>      Select renderer color behavior [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help              Print help

Presentation mode:
  Without an explicit mode, an eligible terminal opens the interactive viewer. Every
  other stream arrangement receives a frozen plain summary.

Attempt selection:
  When --attempt is omitted, the command selects the current attempt from a stable run
  snapshot before opening the selected view.

```
